(20,1,'2026-07-28 02:01:00','2026-07-27 20:01:00','<h1>FAQs.</h1>							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"https://solacewp.com/webcrafters/\">\n											Home\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										/\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										FAQs\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n																	<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1081\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/working-hard-to-produce-creative-results-2023-11-27-05-04-47-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																web development studio					<h2>Building exceptional websites for your success.</h2>		<p>We specialize in designing and developing responsive, user-friendly, and visually stunning websites tailored to your business needs. Whether you’re launching a new online presence or optimizing an existing site, our team combines innovative design with cutting-edge technology to deliver exceptional results.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n			Projects Completed			\n				0\n				K+\n			Satisfaction Rate			\n				0\n				%\n							What We Do					<h2>Building websites that stand out.</h2>		<p>We design, develop, and optimize websites that combine functionality with creativity, delivering tailor-made digital solutions for businesses and individuals.</p>			\n				Custom website design\n				Responsive web development\n				E-commerce solutions\n				Performance optimization\n				Maintenance and support\n																	<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/handsome-programmer-in-headphones-listening-to-mus-2023-11-27-04-56-48-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h5>FAQ</h5>					<h2>Frequently asked questions\n</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Contact us for more\n					</a>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">What services does your web development studio offer?</a>\n					<p>We specialize in custom website design and development, e-commerce solutions, CMS integration, website maintenance, and optimization for performance and SEO.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\"> How long does it take to develop a website?</a>\n					<p>The timeline depends on the complexity of the project. On average, smaller websites take 4–6 weeks, while more complex websites may take 8–12 weeks or longer.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Do you provide e-commerce website development?</a>\n					<p>Yes, we build fully functional e-commerce websites with features like product listings, secure payment gateways, and inventory management to help you sell online.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Do you offer website maintenance and support?</a>\n					<p>Yes, we provide ongoing maintenance packages to ensure your website stays updated, secure, and optimized for performance.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Can I make changes to my website after it’s built?</a>\n					<p>Yes, we can integrate a user-friendly CMS (like WordPress) so you can easily update content, images, and other elements without needing technical expertise.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">What happens if I need help after my website goes live?</a>\n					<p>We offer post-launch support to address any technical issues, updates, or changes you may need after your site is live.</p>','FAQ','','publish','closed','closed','','faq','','','2026-07-28 02:01:13','2026-07-27 20:01:13','',0,'http://localhost:10073/faq/',0,'page','',0),
