(50,1,'2026-07-28 02:01:10','2026-07-27 20:01:10','<h5>We are creative people</h5>							\n							<h1>Experience outstanding web development.</h1>		<p>We prioritize quality, efficiency, and innovation, ensuring every project is delivered with precision and care. From concept to launch, we focus on meeting your unique needs while adhering to timelines, delivering excellence every step of the way.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Our projects\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cheerful-businessman-with-takeaway-drink-looking-a-2024-11-07-16-32-51-utc-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																					<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zm-28.9 143.6l75.5 72.4H120c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24v16c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24h182.6l-75.5 72.4c-9.7 9.3-9.9 24.8-.4 34.3l11 10.9c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0L404.3 273c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L271.6 106.3c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-11 10.9c-9.5 9.6-9.3 25.1.4 34.4z\"></path></svg>			\n									Web design\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zm-28.9 143.6l75.5 72.4H120c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24v16c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24h182.6l-75.5 72.4c-9.7 9.3-9.9 24.8-.4 34.3l11 10.9c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0L404.3 273c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L271.6 106.3c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-11 10.9c-9.5 9.6-9.3 25.1.4 34.4z\"></path></svg>			\n									Web development\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zm-28.9 143.6l75.5 72.4H120c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24v16c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24h182.6l-75.5 72.4c-9.7 9.3-9.9 24.8-.4 34.3l11 10.9c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0L404.3 273c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L271.6 106.3c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-11 10.9c-9.5 9.6-9.3 25.1.4 34.4z\"></path></svg>			\n									No-code development\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zm-28.9 143.6l75.5 72.4H120c-13.3 0-24 10.7-24 24v16c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24h182.6l-75.5 72.4c-9.7 9.3-9.9 24.8-.4 34.3l11 10.9c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0L404.3 273c9.4-9.4 9.4-24.6 0-33.9L271.6 106.3c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0l-11 10.9c-9.5 9.6-9.3 25.1.4 34.4z\"></path></svg>			\n									MVP building\n					</a>\n									<h5>We are trusted by more than 5973 world-class companies</h5>							\n																	<img width=\"2284\" height=\"973\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/new-logocarousel-2.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"2284\" height=\"973\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/new-logocarousel-6.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"2284\" height=\"973\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/new-logocarousel-3.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"2284\" height=\"973\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/new-logocarousel-1.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"2284\" height=\"973\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/new-logocarousel-5.png\" alt=\"\" />																										<img width=\"2284\" height=\"973\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/new-logocarousel.png\" alt=\"\" />																<h5>About us</h5>							\n							<h2>Dedicated development teams that operate as extensions of your internal teams.\n</h2>															<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/multiracial-group-of-coworkers-2023-11-27-04-57-31-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>Building Your Vision Online</h6>		<p>Our web development studio specializes in creating cutting-edge websites that combine innovative design, and user experience. </p>					\n																	<img width=\"64\" height=\"65\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Group_.png\" alt=\"\" />																		\n				0\n				+\n							<h6>Design and develop over 1,500 custom websites across various industries.</h6>															<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Group_-1.png\" alt=\"\" />																		\n				0\n				%\n							<h6>Achieve a 98% client satisfaction rate, showcasing innovation</h6>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n									<h5>Our services</h5>							\n							<h2>\nWe offer an extensive array of services tailored to address the specific needs of our clients in the digital space.</h2>															<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ux-graphic-designer-creative-sketch-planning-appli-2023-11-27-05-09-00-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>Building websites that drive revenue.</h6>					<h4>Web design and redesign</h4>		<p>We know how to create a site that seamlessly blends business objectives with creative design.</p>			<h2>$167</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Book a Service\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/handsome-programmer-in-headphones-listening-to-mus-2023-11-27-04-56-48-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>Transforms ideas into reality.</h6>					<h4>Web development</h4>		<p>We create web projects that add value to your customers by providing an engaging user experience.</p>			<h2>$356</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Book a Service\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/hands-searching-for-plants-buy-online-shop-2023-11-27-05-29-17-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>Solutions for quick launches.</h6>					<h4>No-code development</h4>		<p>Our no-code development enables the creation of fully functional web apps with user roles, dashboards, and views</p>			<h2>$289</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Book a Service\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/creative-team-web-designer-planning-application-de-2023-11-27-05-12-35-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>Validate assumptions and save costs</h6>					<h4>MVP development</h4>		<p>A risk-free approach that saves time, enabling you to test your product\'s viability and collect valuable user feedback</p>			<h2>$834</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Book a Service\n					</a>\n									<h2>\"A seamless web development experience!\"</h2>		<p>Working with WebCrafters was a game-changer for our business. They took the time to understand our goals and delivered a website that was not only visually stunning but also user-friendly. The increase in engagement on our site has been incredible!</p>			<h5>Alex Turner</h5>					<h6>Owner of UrbanGlow Café</h6>					<h6>April 25, 2024</h6>															<img width=\"1068\" height=\"1068\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cheerful-man-using-laptop-in-a-cozy-restaurant-po-2024-10-18-07-51-26-utc-1-1-Cropped.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h5>FAQ</h5>							\n							<h2>Frequently asked questions\n</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Contact us for more\n					</a>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">What services does your web development studio offer?</a>\n					<p>We specialize in custom website design and development, e-commerce solutions, CMS integration, website maintenance, and optimization for performance and SEO.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\"> How long does it take to develop a website?</a>\n					<p>The timeline depends on the complexity of the project. On average, smaller websites take 4–6 weeks, while more complex websites may take 8–12 weeks or longer.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Do you provide e-commerce website development?</a>\n					<p>Yes, we build fully functional e-commerce websites with features like product listings, secure payment gateways, and inventory management to help you sell online.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Do you offer website maintenance and support?</a>\n					<p>Yes, we provide ongoing maintenance packages to ensure your website stays updated, secure, and optimized for performance.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Can I make changes to my website after it’s built?</a>\n					<p>Yes, we can integrate a user-friendly CMS (like WordPress) so you can easily update content, images, and other elements without needing technical expertise.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M240.971 130.524l194.343 194.343c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941l-22.667 22.667c-9.357 9.357-24.522 9.375-33.901.04L224 227.495 69.255 381.516c-9.379 9.335-24.544 9.317-33.901-.04l-22.667-22.667c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941L207.03 130.525c9.372-9.373 24.568-9.373 33.941-.001z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">What happens if I need help after my website goes live?</a>\n					<p>We offer post-launch support to address any technical issues, updates, or changes you may need after your site is live.</p>','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-07-28 02:01:13','2026-07-27 20:01:13','',0,'http://localhost:10073/home/',0,'page','',0),
