(85,1,'2026-07-28 02:01:13','2026-07-27 20:01:13','<h1>About.</h1>							<ul>\n							<li>\n											<a href=\"https://solacewp.com/webcrafters/\">\n											Home\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										/\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										About\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n							<h5>About us</h5>							\n							<h2>Dedicated development teams that operate as extensions of your internal teams.\n</h2>															<img width=\"1600\" height=\"1068\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/multiracial-group-of-coworkers-2023-11-27-04-57-31-utc.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																<h6>Building Your Vision Online</h6>		<p>Our web development studio specializes in creating cutting-edge websites that combine innovative design, and user experience. </p>					\n																	<img width=\"64\" height=\"65\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Group_.png\" alt=\"\" />																		\n				0\n				+\n							<h6>Design and develop over 1,500 custom websites across various industries.</h6>															<img width=\"64\" height=\"64\" src=\"http://localhost:10073/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Group_-1.png\" alt=\"\" />																		\n				0\n				%\n							<h6>Achieve a 98% client satisfaction rate, showcasing innovation</h6>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n									<p>Web Development Solutions</p>					<h2>Our achievement rate in web development.</h2>							\n			<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E&#038;feature=youtu.be\" target=\"_blank\">\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M424.4 214.7L72.4 6.6C43.8-10.3 0 6.1 0 47.9V464c0 37.5 40.7 60.1 72.4 41.3l352-208c31.4-18.5 31.5-64.1 0-82.6z\"></path></svg>			</a>\n				0\n							<h2>Satisfied clients</h2>							\n				0\n							<h2>Expert developers</h2>							\n				0\n							<h2>Certificates obtained</h2>					<p>Awards and achievements</p>					<h2>January 20, 2018</h2>					<h5>Best responsive web design award</h5>		<p>This award recognized our expertise in designing responsive websites that provide an optimal viewing experience across various devices. Our innovative approach ensures that every website we create adapts perfectly to screens of all sizes, enhancing usability.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Read more\n					</a>\n									<h2>May 5, 2018</h2>					<h5>Outstanding e-commerce website award</h5>		<p>Our award-winning e-commerce solution stood out for its intuitive user interface, robust backend, and seamless payment integration. By focusing on user-centric design and advanced functionality, we helped our client achieve a significant increase in online sales</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Read more\n					</a>\n									<h2>September 15, 2018</h2>					<h5>Excellence in UI/UX design</h5>		<p>This award celebrated our expertise in UI/UX design, showcasing our ability to create interfaces that are both visually appealing and highly functional. By conducting in-depth user research, we developed designs that not only met client expectations.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Read more\n					</a>','About','','inherit','closed','closed','','43-revision-v1','','','2026-07-28 02:01:13','2026-07-27 20:01:13','',43,'http://localhost:10073/?p=85',0,'revision','',0),
